# Installation: copy this file to .env and set four different passwords below.
# Use long letters/digits-only passwords (at least 32 characters).
# Then run: docker compose up -d --wait
# Open http://127.0.0.1:13001 and sign in as localadmin with GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD.
#
# Copy adapter/ServerMetricsAdapter.cs into carbon/plugins or oxide/plugins.
# The plugin creates its config: carbon/configs/ServerMetricsAdapter.json
# or oxide/config/ServerMetricsAdapter.json. Set its Password to the WRITE password
# below. Save: the plugin starts automatically within five seconds.
# Change Server in that config if collecting more than one server.
# Keep this .env file with the stack when updating; do not replace its passwords.
INFLUXDB_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
INFLUXDB_WRITE_USER_PASSWORD=
INFLUXDB_READ_USER_PASSWORD=
GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
